Getting started
---------------

Build and boot instructions are maintained in the repository's README.md.
The recommended first test is to build the ISO and boot it in QEMU before
attempting to use it on physical hardware.

Release status
--------------

Version 0.1.0 is an experimental milestone. Users should expect missing
features, limitations and possible bugs. Back up important data and do
not rely on Kanga for critical workloads.
